# Build context of docker/Dockerfile: the workspace's manifests and its crates, without the corpora
# the tests write. crates/conformance/docker/fake-cs2.Dockerfile copies nothing from it.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rustfmt.toml
!clippy.toml
!crates
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-APACHE
!THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt
crates/*/tests/*corpus.jsonl
crates/protocol/tests/corpus.stamp
**/.DS_Store
